34
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:54,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome... He's pretty damn big...</font>

35
00:01:56,170 --> 00:01:57,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh yeah...</font>

36
00:02:06,560 --> 00:02:13,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a... frog... isn't it...?</font>

37
