40
00:02:32,540 --> 00:02:34,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not like this one.</font>

41
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or that one.</font>

42
00:02:36,880 --> 00:02:38,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's really...</font>

43
00:02:38,220 --> 00:02:39,220
