00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:48,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">He Sank!</font>

48
00:02:42,140 --> 00:02:48,140
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Enter, The Frog Boss!!</font>

49
00:02:49,890 --> 00:02:52,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Looks like he extracted the
Chakra of the Nine-Tailed Fox</font>

50
00:02:52,900 --> 00:02:54,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all on his own this time.</font>

51
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:59,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But still, one certainly can't
say he's stable yet...</font>

52
00:02:59,240 --> 00:03:02,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He overused the large Chakra...</font>

53
00:03:02,280 --> 00:03:06,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that of all the frogs
he summoned that one...</font>

54
00:03:08,910 --> 00:03:10,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I did it...</font>

55
00:03:10,420 --> 00:03:11,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, you little brat!</font>

56
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

57
00:03:12,710 --> 00:03:14,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Huh? Huh?!</font>

58
00:03:20,550 --> 00:03:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little brat...</font>

59
00:03:22,930 --> 00:03:26,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On whose head do you think
you're raising a ruckus!</font>

60
00:03:26,640 --> 00:03:32,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the top of Gamabunta-sama,
the Chief Toad's head! You idiot!</font>

61
00:03:32,940 --> 00:03:34,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Quiet down...</font>

62
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

63
00:03:44,490 --> 00:03:47,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell is this guy?!</font>

64
00:03:47,200 --> 00:03:49,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He seems pretty awesome, but...</font>

65
00:03:49,080 --> 00:03:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gimme a break!</font>

66
00:03:50,460 --> 00:03:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just when I'm breathing the air of
the free world after a long time,</font>

67
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:57,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">some weird kid is raising
a ruckus on top of my head.</font>

68
00:03:57,300 --> 00:04:01,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Jiraiya! Where are you?!</font>

69
00:04:01,970 --> 00:04:04,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell do
you think you're doing?!</font>

70
00:04:06,430 --> 00:04:09,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm... This doesn't look good...</font>

71
00:04:09,430 --> 00:04:13,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Cause even I can't handle
that Gamabunta...</font>

72
00:04:13,640 --> 00:04:17,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jiraiya! Hurry up and
show yourself, you idiot!</font>

73
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmmm... It would be troublesome if
that Gama found me out...</font>

74
00:04:22,490 --> 00:04:24,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I better get my ass out of here
without any further delay.</font>

75
00:04:25,240 --> 00:04:27,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, little brat!</font>

76
00:04:27,530 --> 00:04:28,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yes...?</font>

77
00:04:29,040 --> 00:04:31,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Jiraiya?</font>

78
00:04:31,370 --> 00:04:33,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? Jiraiya...?</font>

79
00:04:33,330 --> 00:04:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's that...?</font>

80
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm talking about that lecher who
calls himself Toad Sage or something!</font>

81
00:04:39,090 --> 00:04:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where's Jiraiya? Huh?!</font>

82
00:04:43,970 --> 00:04:45,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Scary...</font>

83
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:48,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you just follow my orders,</font>

84
00:04:48,550 --> 00:04:51,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't mind making you
my henchman!</font>

85
00:04:51,430 --> 00:04:54,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry up and answer me!</font>

86
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:56,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! If you're talking about
the Pervy Sage,</font>

87
00:04:56,560 --> 00:04:59,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's on the cliff up there,
Chief Toad.</font>

88
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:01,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Up there, huh...?</font>

89
00:05:01,360 --> 00:05:04,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Um... Can I ask you one question?</font>

90
00:05:04,610 --> 00:05:06,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

91
00:05:07,320 --> 00:05:09,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What business do you have
with that Pervy Sage?</font>

92
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:13,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the question I want
to ask that pervert!</font>

93
00:05:13,410 --> 00:05:19,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell does he want
summoning me to a place like this?!</font>

94
00:05:20,090 --> 00:05:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

95
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:22,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it?</font>

96
00:05:23,380 --> 00:05:26,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm the one who summoned
you, Chief Toad..</font>

97
00:05:26,970 --> 00:05:28,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I fell off the cliff...</font>

98
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:30,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and thought maybe you
could come to my aid...</font>

99
00:05:30,970 --> 00:05:32,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Please...</font>

100
00:05:33,100 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hmm...?</font>

101
00:05:43,400 --> 00:05:47,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What does a kid like you think
he's saying out of the blue.</font>

102
00:05:48,360 --> 00:05:54,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no way a little squirt like
you could summon a guy like me.</font>

103
00:05:54,580 --> 00:06:00,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's... it's true...
I really truly summoned you...</font>

104
00:06:08,550 --> 00:06:10,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You jerk frog!</font>

105
00:06:10,510 --> 00:06:11,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...?</font>

106
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've been condescending to me</font>

107
00:06:13,260 --> 00:06:15,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and saying whatever you
please since earlier on!</font>

108
00:06:15,430 --> 00:06:21,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since I summoned you,
I'm your master!</font>

109
00:06:21,610 --> 00:06:25,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...? What was that?</font>

110
00:06:25,190 --> 00:06:28,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, who do you think
you're talking to?!</font>

111
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:29,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A little squirt like you,</font>

112
00:06:29,410 --> 00:06:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who isn't even able to exchange cups
of sake as a pledge of friendship,</font>

113
00:06:32,620 --> 00:06:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is saying to Gamabunta-sama,
that you're his master?</font>

114
00:06:35,240 --> 00:06:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could kill you for that! Hey!</font>

115
00:06:39,790 --> 00:06:40,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh...</font>

116
00:06:53,010 --> 00:06:55,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

117
00:07:13,030 --> 00:07:16,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like he emerged on top,
that Gamabunta...</font>

118
00:07:22,880 --> 00:07:25,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Awesome...</font>

119
00:07:29,550 --> 00:07:31,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I hate to tell you this, little brat,</font>

120
00:07:31,840 --> 00:07:34,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but even if I were to concede
a hundred steps to you...</font>

121
00:07:34,390 --> 00:07:35,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, concede a thousand steps to you,</font>

122
00:07:35,390 --> 00:07:39,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and even if it really was true that
it was you who summoned me...</font>

123
00:07:39,270 --> 00:07:42,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're the kind of guy who
falls off my back that easily,</font>

124
00:07:42,440 --> 00:07:46,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there's no way I could
admit you as my master...</font>

125
00:07:46,360 --> 00:07:47,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?! Huh...?!</font>

126
00:07:49,440 --> 00:07:52,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then... I'm here in the
free world after a long time...</font>

127
00:07:52,910 --> 00:07:55,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If Jiraiya doesn't have
any business with me,</font>

128
00:07:55,410 --> 00:07:58,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think I'll kick back for a while.</font>

129
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Wait!</font>

130
00:08:00,540 --> 00:08:03,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why don't you just go home
and sleep or something?</font>

131
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:07,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">'Cause it looks like you're incapable
of serving even as my henchman.</font>

132
00:08:13,880 --> 00:08:15,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

133
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell do you think
you're doing, you little brat?</font>

134
00:08:29,480 --> 00:08:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If my making you recognize that
I summoned you</font>

135
00:08:31,530 --> 00:08:33,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">depends on my not falling
off your back, then...!</font>

136
00:08:33,570 --> 00:08:38,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I won't get off your back
the entire day today no matter what!</font>

137
00:08:38,910 --> 00:08:40,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

138
00:08:40,580 --> 00:08:45,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And by my doing that I'll make
you recognize me as your master!</font>

139
00:08:46,380 --> 00:08:51,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You little brat! Don't get all carried away
thinking I'll go easy on you!</font>

140
00:08:52,470 --> 00:08:53,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

141
00:08:53,510 --> 00:08:55,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fall!</font>

142
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra adhesion!</font>

143
00:09:05,770 --> 00:09:07,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's not enough Chakra!</font>

144
00:09:08,860 --> 00:09:11,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen carefully, Chief Toad!</font>

145
00:09:11,780 --> 00:09:14,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My name is Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

146
00:09:14,530 --> 00:09:17,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm a man who will become Hokage
in the future. Don't forget that!</font>

147
00:09:17,450 --> 00:09:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who cares!</font>

148
00:09:25,580 --> 00:09:29,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is getting pretty interesting.</font>

149
00:09:29,340 --> 00:09:30,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

150
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:32,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh my gosh!</font>

151
00:09:36,590 --> 00:09:41,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry Naruto,
but I've gotta get back to work!</font>

152
00:09:43,310 --> 00:09:45,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Research... research...</font>

153
00:09:54,860 --> 00:09:56,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bust off!</font>

154
00:10:13,460 --> 00:10:14,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Welcome!</font>

155
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna eat my fill.</font>

156
00:10:17,300 --> 00:10:20,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh... Those guys are
eating barbecue again, huh?</font>

157
00:10:20,800 --> 00:10:23,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A reward for having trained
earnestly... maybe?</font>

158
00:10:24,270 --> 00:10:28,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I thought you were told not to
let Gaara out of your sight...</font>

159
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:31,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't worry...
even somebody like him...</font>

160
00:10:32,060 --> 00:10:35,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">wouldn't dare to do anything
in broad daylight.</font>

161
00:10:35,900 --> 00:10:38,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More importantly,
that guy Shikamaru or whatever,</font>

162
00:10:39,030 --> 00:10:41,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's the first guy
you're fighting, right?</font>

163
00:10:41,740 --> 00:10:44,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shouldn't you be formulating
a battle plan?</font>

164
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:48,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph... There's no way I would
lose to a guy of that level...</font>

165
00:10:48,830 --> 00:10:49,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Besides...</font>

166
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:51,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You botched it, didn't you?</font>

167
00:10:51,380 --> 00:10:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

168
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:55,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you had taken the exam
one year earlier,</font>

169
00:10:55,420 --> 00:10:57,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you would have made
the Chunin easily...</font>

170
00:10:59,430 --> 00:11:00,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't say it...</font>

171
00:11:06,350 --> 00:11:07,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What was that?!</font>

172
00:11:08,310 --> 00:11:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The upcoming Chunin Exam...</font>

173
00:11:10,770 --> 00:11:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll have the three of you from
our Sand Village take the exam...</font>

174
00:11:15,230 --> 00:11:19,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the reason for doing that
is not to pass the Chunin Exam!</font>

175
00:11:20,030 --> 00:11:22,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is to use the opportunity
of the Chunin Exam...</font>

176
00:11:22,200 --> 00:11:24,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to crush Leaf Village!</font>

177
00:11:25,200 --> 00:11:31,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But why...? Don't we have
a treaty with Leaf Village?!</font>

178
00:11:32,750 --> 00:11:35,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That treaty is the problem.</font>

179
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:36,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh.</font>

180
00:11:36,630 --> 00:11:37,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

181
00:11:38,760 --> 00:11:41,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You Genin are not aware of
the detail but...</font>

182
00:11:42,010 --> 00:11:43,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the time the treaty was concluded,</font>

183
00:11:44,180 --> 00:11:48,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that idiot feudal lord of Land of Wind
not only aggressively scaled down</font>

184
00:11:48,310 --> 00:11:51,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the arsenal of
the Hidden Sand Village...</font>

185
00:11:52,230 --> 00:11:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he delegated to the Leaf Village</font>

186
00:11:53,850 --> 00:11:56,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">matters that should have been handled
by our country, and moreover,</font>

187
00:11:56,360 --> 00:12:02,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">significantly cut our country's budget
and slashed the number of Shinobi.</font>

188
00:12:03,070 --> 00:12:04,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When we have an idiot leader,</font>

189
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:07,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we, the arms and legs
of the country, suffer.</font>

190
00:12:07,330 --> 00:12:09,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The only choice we had left
was to improve the quality</font>

191
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">of each and every Shinobi in order
to maintain our country's military power...</font>

192
00:12:14,380 --> 00:12:18,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why Shinobi like
you were created...</font>

193
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:21,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gaara...</font>

194
00:12:22,090 --> 00:12:27,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Land of Wind's security is
in extreme danger right now!</font>

195
00:12:28,100 --> 00:12:32,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But the aides
of that idiot feudal lord...</font>

196
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:34,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">don't have a clue!</font>

197
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:36,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kazakage-sama,</font>

198
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:40,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">who detected the weakening in the military
strength of the Hidden Sand Village,</font>

199
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:42,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">joined hands with
the Hidden Sound Village</font>

200
00:12:43,030 --> 00:12:45,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and decided to take down
the Hidden Leaf Village...</font>

201
00:12:46,410 --> 00:12:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In addition to restoring Sand
Village authority...</font>

202
00:12:49,490 --> 00:12:52,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this needs to be done in order
to make that idiot feudal lord</font>

203
00:12:52,120 --> 00:12:54,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">aware of the importance of
crisis preparedness...</font>

204
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:01,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If any more time passes,
our Sand Village will totally lose</font>

205
00:13:01,130 --> 00:13:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">its military capabilities
against the Leaf Village...</font>

206
00:13:05,130 --> 00:13:06,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now is the only chance...</font>

207
00:13:07,430 --> 00:13:12,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The success of that mission...
Gaara... depends on your work...</font>

208
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:16,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

209
00:13:17,270 --> 00:13:19,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If the strategy is carried out,</font>

210
00:13:19,230 --> 00:13:21,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it will certainly lead to war
with the Leaf Village.</font>

211
00:13:22,110 --> 00:13:24,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll be at war again...?</font>

212
00:13:25,490 --> 00:13:29,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The cost to human life in implementing
the treaty was very great...</font>

213
00:13:29,200 --> 00:13:34,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if it is broken... then again...
many people will die...</font>

214
00:13:34,330 --> 00:13:36,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">H-Hey... Temari...</font>

215
00:13:36,460 --> 00:13:39,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the will of Kazekage-sama.</font>

216
00:13:40,920 --> 00:13:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of Kazekage-sama?</font>

217
00:13:43,130 --> 00:13:45,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">After all, Shinobi are simply
tools for fighting.</font>

218
00:13:46,010 --> 00:13:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The treaty did nothing more than
jeopardize our very existence.</font>

219
00:13:55,230 --> 00:13:57,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is a super A-rank mission.</font>

220
00:13:57,900 --> 00:13:59,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">See it through with great care!</font>

221
00:14:00,310 --> 00:14:01,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay.</font>

222
00:14:02,400 --> 00:14:03,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes...</font>

223
00:14:07,320 --> 00:14:11,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A day sure is long when
one's not doing anything.</font>

224
00:14:13,370 --> 00:14:14,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess...</font>

225
00:14:38,270 --> 00:14:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... What an obstinate little squirt.</font>

226
00:15:03,090 --> 00:15:08,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Goodness... that Naruto seems
like he's in agony...</font>

227
00:15:10,550 --> 00:15:13,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He must have exhausted
most of his Chakra</font>

228
00:15:13,430 --> 00:15:16,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when he summoned Gamabunta...</font>

229
00:15:17,560 --> 00:15:19,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, look, isn't that pretty...</font>

230
00:15:19,180 --> 00:15:20,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The rainbow...</font>

231
00:15:20,270 --> 00:15:21,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Gorgeous...</font>

232
00:15:22,190 --> 00:15:25,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah, yeah, absolutely gorgeous, isn't it.</font>

233
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:36,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work, Baki.</font>

234
00:15:36,870 --> 00:15:40,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kazekage-sama, I successfully
moved all three pawns</font>

235
00:15:40,960 --> 00:15:43,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the real battle as planned.</font>

236
00:15:44,920 --> 00:15:48,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The agreement with the Sound Village side
has been progressing with no problem too.</font>

237
00:15:48,210 --> 00:15:49,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

238
00:15:51,510 --> 00:15:52,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is...</font>

239
00:15:53,180 --> 00:15:56,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A decisive action plan from
the Sound Village.</font>

240
00:16:11,320 --> 00:16:13,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still have something you want?</font>

241
00:16:13,610 --> 00:16:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well...</font>

242
00:16:14,910 --> 00:16:17,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? Come out with it.</font>

243
00:16:17,120 --> 00:16:20,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir... I was wondering if you
could position some soldiers</font>

244
00:16:20,500 --> 00:16:23,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">near the border on the pretext of
undertaking a tactical exercise.</font>

245
00:16:23,170 --> 00:16:24,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With only the four of us...</font>

246
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Leaf Village aren't idiots either.</font>

247
00:16:27,460 --> 00:16:30,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Their ANBU black ops
are moving about.</font>

248
00:16:30,210 --> 00:16:34,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we do that, they will see right through
what we're contemplating.</font>

249
00:16:34,050 --> 00:16:36,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But with only our current
military capability...</font>

250
00:16:37,010 --> 00:16:39,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why I sent Gaara and
the others out there.</font>

251
00:16:40,220 --> 00:16:45,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The restoration of the authority of
the Hidden Sand Village is resting on you.</font>

252
00:16:47,190 --> 00:16:49,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... Go.</font>

253
00:16:49,610 --> 00:16:50,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes, sir.</font>

254
00:16:59,990 --> 00:17:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's only a little more time remaining
until the sun sets completely...</font>

255
00:17:04,410 --> 00:17:05,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and if I don't fall off...</font>

256
00:17:05,670 --> 00:17:08,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll be the master!</font>

257
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:10,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that to me?!</font>

258
00:17:10,130 --> 00:17:12,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You came up with this
whole thing on your own.</font>

259
00:17:12,710 --> 00:17:15,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not falling off, no matter what!</font>

260
00:17:17,390 --> 00:17:21,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...
he's already way past his limit...</font>

261
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:25,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I wouldn't be surprised if
he fell off any minute now...</font>

262
00:17:30,320 --> 00:17:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I could simply ignore what
a brat like him says...</font>

263
00:17:34,150 --> 00:17:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but taking a lick really irritates me.</font>

264
00:17:39,370 --> 00:17:42,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm gonna bring this
to an end once and for all...</font>

265
00:17:43,290 --> 00:17:46,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, brat... what's your name?</font>

266
00:17:46,620 --> 00:17:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

267
00:17:47,790 --> 00:17:49,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

268
00:17:50,250 --> 00:17:54,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Uzumaki Naruto... Naruto!</font>

269
00:17:54,800 --> 00:17:57,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't hold it against me if you die!</font>

270
00:18:07,560 --> 00:18:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh...</font>

271
00:18:08,850 --> 00:18:10,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Gamabunta!</font>

272
00:18:10,610 --> 00:18:13,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now it's a matter of pride for him, too!</font>

273
00:18:13,650 --> 00:18:14,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?!</font>

274
00:18:15,570 --> 00:18:16,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This won't do!</font>

275
00:18:20,490 --> 00:18:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! This is the sizzling young ladies'
entertainment spot!</font>

276
00:18:28,620 --> 00:18:33,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not falling off when
I'm so close to succeeding!</font>

277
00:18:34,000 --> 00:18:35,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!
Oh...</font>

278
00:18:35,670 --> 00:18:36,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

279
00:18:37,170 --> 00:18:38,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Naruto...</font>

280
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:41,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's squeezing out yet more Chakra
from that condition he's in.</font>

281
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:56,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm falling...</font>

282
00:19:17,800 --> 00:19:22,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How do you like that, Gamabunta?
I'm still on your back!</font>

283
00:19:24,470 --> 00:19:25,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's my victory!</font>

284
00:19:29,690 --> 00:19:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh no! If he falls like that he'll die!</font>

285
00:19:47,330 --> 00:19:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Too bad for you... You almost made it.</font>

286
00:19:56,420 --> 00:20:00,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think that he could hold out like that
against a tough opponent like Gamabunta...</font>

287
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hm?!</font>

288
00:20:20,400 --> 00:20:24,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That, Jiraiya, meddling in...</font>

289
00:20:24,870 --> 00:20:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am fully aware of the fact that...</font>

290
00:20:26,780 --> 00:20:29,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">this guy here summoned
me all on his own.</font>

291
00:20:30,370 --> 00:20:33,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean, it's the first time since
the Fourth Hokage</font>

292
00:20:33,710 --> 00:20:36,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that somebody climbed on my head.</font>

293
00:20:36,710 --> 00:20:39,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As might be expected,
he must be totally drained.</font>

294
00:20:39,840 --> 00:20:43,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't mind dispensing some
of my power to him but...</font>

295
00:20:44,300 --> 00:20:48,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Taking him to that place would be best.</font>

296
00:20:51,810 --> 00:20:53,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Huh?
— What!</font>

297
00:21:13,470 --> 00:21:16,810
